{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>ויען</b>: Rabbi Moses the Persian said: \"I was not a prophet of HaShem nor a son of a prophet, for I was a keeper of cattle or a plower of cattle. And because he mentioned 'from behind the flock,' it indicates that he was a shepherd, as he mentioned regarding the herdsmen.\""], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:29.100501726Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}